eb:.3f}] at 2 SE {'COVERS' if abs(-b1-3.867)<2*seb else 'DOES NOT COVER'} the predicted 3.867\")\nprint()\nprint(\"  the excluded leg: sweep-t12288-r3 204.87 vs a cohort of 165.69-176.54 ms/fwd in the same\")\nprint(\"  arm at the same tau and width. Its BEFORE leg (216.55) is unremarkable, so it is the after\")\nprint(\"  leg that was disturbed. Included, the slope is:\")\npts2=[(A[k]['ctx']/1000.0,B[k]['fwd']-A[k]['fwd']) for k in sorted(A) if k in B\n      and abs(A[k]['tau']-B[k]['tau'])<1e-9 and abs(A[k]['w']-B[k]['w'])<1e-9]\nn2=len(pts2);xs2=[p[0] for p in pts2];ys2=[p[1] for p in pts2]\nmx2,my2=sum(xs2)/n2,sum(ys2)/n2\nb1b=sum((x-mx2)*(y-my2) for x,y in zip(xs2,ys2))/sum((x-mx2)**2 for x in xs2)\nres2=[y-(my2+b1b*(x-mx2)) for x,y in zip(xs2,ys2)]\ns2b=sum(r*r for r in res2)/(n2-2); sebb=(s2b/sum((x-mx2)**2 for x in xs2))**0.5\nprint(f\"    {-b1b:.3f} +/- {sebb:.3f} ms per 1000 (n={n2}) -- same conclusion, wider band.\")\nPY","description":"Fit paired saving vs context"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2691,"cache_read_input_tokens":131803,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2691},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d70d126-0070-4925-875e-05d6ca119884","uuid":"62fed163-56c7-456e-bc90-bdbd3882644f","timestamp":"2026-08-20T07:25:01.218Z","request_id":"req_011CeDbozv1CMmrmqnv7fXa3"}
